0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 449.00 Td (The Clinic Queue Tracking System is a mobile-responsive web application designed to solve waiting-time) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 435.00 Td (uncertainty for registered patients at busy outpatient department \(OPD\) clinics.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 421.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 407.00 Td (1. Patient Experience \(Mobile-First\): Patients complete in-person front desk registration, receiving a paper) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 393.00 Td (   slip with their token number \(e.g. 021, 022, 023, 024, 025\). On their smartphones, they navigate to the) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 379.00 Td (   website, enter their token, and view live status: their exact place in line, number of patients ahead, an) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 365.00 Td (   approximate wait time \(e.g. 20-30 mins\), an intuitive 5-segment progress bar, and doctor delay disclaimers.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 351.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 337.00 Td (2. Turn Approaching Alert: When a patient is next in line or being called, an eye-catching banner notifies) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 323.00 Td (   them immediately to proceed to Consultation Room 1, reducing waiting-hall crowding.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 309.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 295.00 Td (3. Receptionist Queue Control: Clinic receptionists log into a password-protected dashboard to call the next) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 281.00 Td (   patient with one click. Queue advancement propagates to patient screens instantly without manual reloads.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 267.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 253.00 Td (4. Data Privacy & Zero PHI: The system requires no patient accounts, app installs, or sensitive medical records.) Tj ET
