0.1 0.18 0.32 rg BT /F2 10 Tf 40.00 671.00 Td (## 1. Project Goal & MVP Scope) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 40.00 656.00 Td (1.1 Problem Statement: In busy outpatient department \(OPD\) clinics, patients receive a paper token after registration) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 40.00 645.00 Td (but often have no visibility into how many patients are ahead of them or when they will be called. This causes anxiety,) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 40.00 634.00 Td (frequent inquiries at the reception counter, and overcrowding in waiting corridors.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 40.00 619.00 Td (1.2 Solution & MVP Objective: A lightweight, mobile-first web application that allows patients who already hold a physical) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 40.00 608.00 Td (paper token \(e.g., 021, 022, 023, 024, 025\) to look up their current queue status and estimated waiting time. A secure,) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 40.00 597.00 Td (authenticated receptionist dashboard allows clinic staff to advance the queue in real-time.) Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 8.5 Tf 40.00 582.00 Td (1.3 Strict Scope Boundaries \(MoSCoW Alignment\):) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 570.00 Td (*  1. Patient Token Lookup: Single-field mobile screen to enter existing token \(025\) with demo shortcut and error handling.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 559.00 Td (*  2. Queue Position & Wait Time Display: Displays token, status, patients ahead, estimated wait \(20-30m\), 5-step progress bar.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 548.00 Td (*  3. Turn Approaching Alert: Status alert informing patient when turn is next or called to proceed to consultation room.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 537.00 Td (*  4. Receptionist Dashboard: Protected staff dashboard showing current, next, waiting count, Call Patient buttons, Update Queue.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 526.00 Td (*  5. Data Persistence & Security: Firebase Firestore for live shared queue state; Firebase Auth restricting writes to staff.) Tj ET
0.6 0.1 0.1 rg BT /F2 8.5 Tf 40.00 511.00 Td (OUT OF SCOPE \(Won't Have Now\):) Tj ET
0.35 0.4 0.45 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 499.00 Td (*  No online patient self-registration or appointment booking \(tokens issued in person at reception counter\).) Tj ET
0.35 0.4 0.45 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 488.00 Td (*  No automatic digital token generation | No online payments, billing, or prescription integration.) Tj ET
0.35 0.4 0.45 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 477.00 Td (*  No third-party notification channels \(SMS, WhatsApp, email\) -- status is checked on the web page.) Tj ET
0.35 0.4 0.45 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 48.00 466.00 Td (*  No collection of real or sensitive Patient Health Information \(PHI\) -- strictly tokens and status.) Tj ET
